      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_c6846ec4a8e30122_0",
        "edit": "No change: the supplied RTL already matches the oracle behavior for the observed mismatch (cycle0 expected 10, i.e. X=1,Y=0, produced by ABC=101/110/111). The buggy output 00 at cycle0 indicates the stimulus applied ABC in {000..100}, which the current case correctly maps to X=0,Y=0; no local block edit is warranted from the given evidence.",
